  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"menu-route current\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/newsletter/\"><span>Newsletter</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/feedback/\"><span>Get in touch</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"inter-hero\"><div class=\"inter-hero-image\"><img alt=\"A permaculture landscape\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"919\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 90vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/bec8980b-about-img-hb-1a7e96d4ab5f-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/bec8980b-about-img-hb-1a7e96d4ab5f-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/bec8980b-about-img-hb-1a7e96d4ab5f-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/bec8980b-about-img-hb-1a7e96d4ab5f-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/bec8980b-about-img-hb-1a7e96d4ab5f-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/bec8980b-about-img-hb-1a7e96d4ab5f-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"1920\"/></div><div class=\"inter-shade\"></div><h1><span>CONNECTED</span><span>BY NATURE.</span></h1><div class=\"inter-hero-bottom\"><p>The story behind Mycelium.<br/>Rooted in the Philippines.<br/>Open to the world.</p><div class=\"equal-actions\"><a class=\"action\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Browse Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"action\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Explore the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><a aria-label=\"Scroll to discover\" class=\"inter-scroll\" href=\"#inter-intro\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"inter-intro\" id=\"inter-intro\"><span class=\"section-label\">How it started</span><p class=\"inter-statement\"><span>Have you ever wondered why nature wastes nothing, and wondered why we can't do the same?</span></p><div class=\"origin-grid\"><div class=\"reading-copy\"><p>In natural systems, there is no such thing as waste. All organic matter moves through closed-loop cycles where what one process discards becomes essential for another. The result is a self-sufficient balance that sustains everything around it.</p><p>Human systems often operate differently. We extract, consume, and discard linearly. So how do we construct systems that don't inevitably create the very problems they set out to solve?</p><p>I found the answer at Perma-Kapihan, an event held by the Philippine Permaculture Association, where I first heard of permaculture.</p></div><img alt=\"The beginnings of a permaculture journey\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2c3a319b-about-img-02-e6c7ed6beb7f-600.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2c3a319b-about-img-02-e6c7ed6beb7f-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/2c3a319b-about-img-02-e6c7ed6beb7f-600.webp 600w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"600\"/><noscript><img alt=\"The beginnings of a permaculture journey\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2c3a319b-about-img-02-e6c7ed6beb7f-600.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/2c3a319b-about-img-02-e6c7ed6beb7f-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/2c3a319b-about-img-02-e6c7ed6beb7f-600.webp 600w\" width=\"600\"/></noscript></div></section><section class=\"about-reading\"><div class=\"reading-heading\"><span class=\"section-label\">The turning point</span><h2>Why this<br/>matters to me.</h2></div><div class=\"reading-copy\"><p>Stepping foot into Bert's home felt like entering an entirely new universe. Seeing food, water, and nature orchestrated in a manner that worked harmoniously fundamentally redefined how I thought environments could be designed. The reciprocity I observed inspired me to understand not just the \"what\" of these systems, but also the \"why\" and \"how\".</p><p>Exploring these ideas further, I discovered that the patterns I observed in Bert's home were echoed in the research I came across, with permaculture systems continuously sustaining notably higher biodiversity than conventional land use, improving environmental health like air quality, and redirecting waste streams away from disposal and towards repurposing.</p><p>Falling into this rabbit hole of holism and seeing their real-world impact compelled me to attended a formal Permaculture Design Course in Nueva Ecija, hosted by Beert. This 7 day immersive course gave me the opportunity to understand all the mechanics that i had initially observed at Bert's house.</p><h3>Here’s the thing…</h3><p>As I went deeper into permaculture, I realized how overwhelming it can be to enter the field. The knowledge is vast, scattered across books, courses, research papers, and personal interpretations. For someone just starting out, it's difficult to know where to begin and how to translate abstract principles into something tangible.</p><p>It was also there that a specific moment had a profound impact on me: a banana tree mulching area that was filled with layers upon layers of decomposing leaves and plant matter. Banana plants contended with each other and those that fell didn't vanish uselessly. They cycled back into the soil, enriching it and catalyzing the emergence of new plants. This organic nutrient-rich mulch that would typically contribute to municipal landfills instead became the foundation of soil regeneration.</p><p>All of this ultimately inspired Mycelium. The platform represents my attempt to translate the principles and lessons I've experienced into something concrete, organized, accessible resource where curious minds can explore, learn, and apply holistic systems thinking. Creating Mycelium matters to me because it allows me to share the insights I've gained, while making Permaculture less overwhelming for others starting out, just as I once was.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"about-evidence\"><figure><img alt=\"A permaculture landscape\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-812.webp 812w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"726\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"812\"/><noscript><img alt=\"A permaculture landscape\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"726\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/df6d91e0-about-img-03-100b781a3e32-812.webp 812w\" width=\"812\"/></noscript><figcaption>Patterns observed in practice.</figcaption></figure><div><div class=\"why-dark-box\"> <img alt=\"Landfill waste composition before and after permaculture\" class=\"why-chart\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-804.webp 804w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"393\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"804\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Landfill waste composition before and after permaculture\" class=\"why-chart\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"393\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/ae3b2dba-about-img-05-af42a6af9f0c-804.webp 804w\" width=\"804\"/></noscript> <p class=\"why-chart-caption\">Permaculture composting can divert up to 77% of organic waste from landfills, reducing the organic waste proportion in landfill from about 35% to just 11%. This significant reduction helps decrease landfill volume and greenhouse gas emissions, promoting a more sustainable waste management system.</p> </div><div class=\"why-dark-box\"> <img alt=\"Improves biodiversity 3x\" class=\"why-bio-card\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-809.webp 809w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"397\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"809\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Improves biodiversity 3x\" class=\"why-bio-card\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"397\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/4fb389a4-about-img-04-796b7ca157bb-809.webp 809w\" width=\"809\"/></noscript> <p class=\"why-bio-caption\">Permaculture areas show three times more plant species than conventional agriculture (Farming insider). Urban permaculture contributes to habitat restoration, supports pollinators, and increases soil microorganisms essential for nutrient cycling and decomposition.</p> </div></div></section><section class=\"inter-cinema cinema-learn cinema-share\"><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: an open field journal and an empty chair at a quiet garden table\" class=\"cinema-image\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2048\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: an open field journal and an empty chair at a quiet garden table\" class=\"cinema-image\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-share-story-9daba946a455-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2048\"/></noscript><div class=\"inter-shade\"></div><h2><span>SHARE</span><span>YOUR STORY.</span></h2><div class=\"cinema-bottom\"><p>What brought you to permaculture? Share your experience and hear another perspective.</p><a class=\"action\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Explore the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"inter-horizontal\" id=\"inter-fields\"><div class=\"inter-horizontal-stage\"><div class=\"inter-track\"><article class=\"inter-panel inter-text-panel\"><span class=\"field-label\">A closer look</span><h2>Learning<br/>by living.</h2><p>A change in perspective starts with paying attention to the life around us.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Browse Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></article><div class=\"inter-panel inter-photo-panel inter-soil-panel\"><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: exposed tree roots and leaf litter along a natural forest bank\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-1920.webp 1920w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-2560.webp 2560w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-3520.webp 3520w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2352\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, max(75vw, 173vh)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"3520\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: exposed tree roots and leaf litter along a natural forest bank\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2352\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, max(75vw, 173vh)\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-1920.webp 1920w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-2560.webp 2560w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-forest-roots-620fee09d95e-3520.webp 3520w\" width=\"3520\"/></noscript><span>Life above and below.</span></div><div class=\"inter-panel inter-strip-panel\"><figure><img alt=\"Young leaves growing beside fresh garden soil\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-736.webp 736w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"981\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"736\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Young leaves growing beside fresh garden soil\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"981\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/garden-soil-supplied-a8625585204e-736.webp 736w\" width=\"736\"/></noscript><figcaption>Observe what’s here.</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"A ground-level view through grass and leaves into a blue sky\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-736.webp 736w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"736\"/><noscript><img alt=\"A ground-level view through grass and leaves into a blue sky\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"920\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/ground-level-leaves-supplied-271465d0d910-736.webp 736w\" width=\"736\"/></noscript><figcaption>Look a little closer.</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: a healed citrus graft and new leaves\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2048\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: a healed citrus graft and new leaves\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-grafting-b0e512428744-1920.webp 1920w\" width=\"2048\"/></noscript><figcaption>Work with the landscape.</figcaption></figure></div><article class=\"inter-panel inter-text-panel\"><span class=\"field-label\">Alongside each other</span><h2>Shared<br/>understanding.</h2><p>From conversations to fieldwork, knowledge grows as it moves between people.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Explore the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></article><div class=\"inter-panel inter-photo-panel\"><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: young plants in a small tropical nursery\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-1920.webp 1920w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 65vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"2048\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Illustrative photograph: young plants in a small tropical nursery\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1360\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:900px) 100vw, 65vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3c89a3da11ac-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/editorial-nursery-3