ign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-1024.webp 1024w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1024\"/><noscript><img alt=\"An illustrative view of a living landscape\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/e97b12c9-Eduardo-Terzidis-Online-Permaculture-7521a18e3878-1024.webp 1024w\" width=\"1024\"/></noscript><figcaption>Find a place to begin.</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hands sharing a meal around a table\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-1400.webp 1400w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1400\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Hands sharing a meal around a table\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1738\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/fba47ed8-a09-table-3d6dd53e437e-1400.webp 1400w\" width=\"1400\"/></noscript><figcaption>Keep learning together.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inter-track-progress\"><span></span></div><a class=\"inter-skip\" href=\"#community-impact\">Skip gallery <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"about-impact-section\" id=\"community-impact\"><header><span class=\"section-label\">Measuring impact</span><h2>Small shifts.<br/>Lasting roots.</h2><p>With Right Start Community Development Center.</p></header><div class=\"impact-reading\"><div class=\"impact-gallery has-circles\"><img alt=\"Children at Right Start potting seedlings in clay pots\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-660.webp 660w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, 30vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"660\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Children at Right Start potting seedlings in clay pots\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, 30vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/dcadd70f-about-img-06-3b62d7be9cfb-660.webp 660w\" width=\"660\"/></noscript><img alt=\"Children at Right Start planting seedlings along a garden bed\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-660.webp 660w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, 30vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"660\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Children at Right Start planting seedlings along a garden bed\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, 30vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/206dad31-about-img-07-9862672381aa-660.webp 660w\" width=\"660\"/></noscript><img alt=\"A hand holding freshly picked bitter gourds\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-660.webp 660w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, 30vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"660\"/><noscript><img alt=\"A hand holding freshly picked bitter gourds\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"660\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, 30vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/72d5458f-about-img-08-1e7b906cca84-660.webp 660w\" width=\"660\"/></noscript></div><div class=\"reading-copy\"><p>Right Start Community Development Center supports children and families in Quezon City, Metro Manila, through education, creativity, and daily engagement.</p><p>Through Right Start, Mycelium observes what happens when permaculture knowledge enters a community as a way of thinking rather than a set of instructions. Instead of tracking just participation I also look at shifts in perspective: how people begin to see waste, food, land, and responsibility as parts of a connected system.</p><p>I've observed that the earliest signs of impact often aren't physical. They appear in questions asked, in habits slowly adjusted, and in how individuals begin to explain these ideas to others. Over time, this knowledge compounds, passing between others and adapting to unique situations.</p><p>Right Start provides a living environment to observe this process. The community is not a test site, but an environment where learning and adaptation happen continuously. Measuring impact here means paying attention to growth that isn't always immediate or visible, but rooted deeply enough to last.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"about-mission-section\"><div class=\"mission-lead\"><div class=\"mission-copy\"><span class=\"section-label\">My mission</span><h2>The platform I wished<br/>I could find.</h2><p class=\"mission-intro\">I bring scattered permaculture knowledge into one place, with partners like the Baganihan Collective and the Philippine Permaculture Association.</p></div><figure class=\"mission-photo\"><img alt=\"Illustrative image: a desk late at night with a glowing laptop, permaculture books and handwritten garden notes\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-640.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-1536.webp 1536w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"1536\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Illustrative image: a desk late at night with a glowing laptop, permaculture books and handwritten garden notes\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-1440.webp 1440w, /redesign/delivery/media/mission-late-night-ae4f6cbb6d29-1536.webp 1536w\" width=\"1536\"/></noscript></figure></div><div class=\"mission-rows\"><div class=\"mission-row\"><h3>Learning resources</h3><p>Videos, courses and reading, from beginner introductions to deeper discussions.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Browse Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mission-row\"><h3>Community conversations</h3><p>Common Ground, the forum: answer statements, compare views, post.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Explore the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"mission-row\"><h3>Events</h3><p>Talks, workshops and courses with partners.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>View Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><div class=\"about-standards\"><section class=\"about-criteria\" id=\"criteria\"> <div class=\"section-inner\"> <h3 class=\"section-eyebrow center\">OUR CRITERIA</h3> <h2 class=\"section-h2 center\">Three questions every resource must answer.</h2> <div class=\"criteria-grid\"> <div class=\"criteria-item\"> <span class=\"criteria-num\">01</span> <div> <h3 class=\"criteria-q\">Can a beginner understand it?</h3> <p class=\"criteria-a\">Mycelium organizes permaculture videos into clear categories – from beginner introductions to podcasts and deeper philosophical discussions on regenerative systems.</p> </div> </div><div class=\"criteria-item\"> <span class=\"criteria-num\">02</span> <div> <h3 class=\"criteria-q\">Is this knowledge proven in practice?</h3> <p class=\"criteria-a\">Not just written about, but also practiced in an actual location. A resource passes this check if the knowledge it teaches has been applied somewhere real.</p> </div> </div><div class=\"criteria-item\"> <span class=\"criteria-num\">03</span> <div> <h3 class=\"criteria-q\">Do we trust this source?</h3> <p class=\"criteria-a\">Content connected to our partner network holds accountability. When it's outside that network, we cross-check it against what our partners have taught in the field.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class=\"about-partners\"> <div class=\"section-inner\"> <h3 class=\"section-eyebrow center\">OUR PARTNERS</h3> <h2 class=\"section-h2 center\">The field organizations that keep us honest</h2> <p class=\"partners-intro\">Every resource and every claim is backed by people who have spent decades growing food, building communities, and practicing permaculture on the ground.</p> <div class=\"partners-grid\"> <div class=\"partner-card\"> <img alt=\"Baganihan Collective\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/161cf069-about-img-09-256997152353-457.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/161cf069-about-img-09-256997152353-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/161cf069-about-img-09-256997152353-457.webp 457w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"195\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"457\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Baganihan Collective\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"195\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/161cf069-about-img-09-256997152353-457.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/161cf069-about-img-09-256997152353-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/161cf069-about-img-09-256997152353-457.webp 457w\" width=\"457\"/></noscript> <h3 class=\"partner-name\">Baganihan Collective</h3> <p class=\"partner-desc\">A network of permaculture practitioners, led by Hubert Posadas, working across six pilot communities in the Philippines. Their fieldwork, experiments, and local knowledge are documented and shared through Mycelium.</p> </div><div class=\"partner-card\"> <img alt=\"Philippine Permaculture Association\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/777b4d28-about-img-10-188cc9fbe68b-457.webp\" data-srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/777b4d28-about-img-10-188cc9fbe68b-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/777b4d28-about-img-10-188cc9fbe68b-457.webp 457w\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"195\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAD/ACwAAAAAAQABAAACADs=\" width=\"457\"/><noscript><img alt=\"Philippine Permaculture Association\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"195\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 90vw, (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 35vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/777b4d28-about-img-10-188cc9fbe68b-457.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/777b4d28-about-img-10-188cc9fbe68b-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/777b4d28-about-img-10-188cc9fbe68b-457.webp 457w\" width=\"457\"/></noscript> <h3 class=\"partner-name\">Philippine Permaculture Association</h3> <p class=\"partner-desc\">The national network advancing permaculture in the Philippine through education and community projects. PPA is led by Bert Peeters.</p> </div> </div> </div> </section></div></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-invitation\"><h2>Stay curious.<br/><span>Grow together.</span></h2><p>Rooted in the Philippines.<br/>Open to the world.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Explore Mycelium\" class=\"footer-destinations\"><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Browse Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Explore the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Watch videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>